OL,3,GNEWSACity streets hit by flooding after
OL,4,Aheavy downpours
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity streets have been hit by flash
OL,7,Fflooding with a number of homes and
OL,8,Fbusinesses affected after heavy rain
OL,9,Fmoved through the region on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe Labour MP for Peterborough, Andrew
OL,12,FPakes, shared an image of a heavily
OL,13,Fwaterlogged street, with fellow city
OL,14,Fcouncillors posting similar pictures of
OL,15,Fflooding in the St Paul's Road and the
OL,16,FWoodcote Close area.
OL,18,FReports on social media also showed
OL,19,Fsome supermarkets, a library and a gym
OL,20,Famong businesses forced to shut across
OL,21,Fparts of Peterborough and Fenland.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
