OL,3,GNEWSACity streets hit by flooding after
OL,4,Aheavy downpours
OL,5,
OL,6,FPakes said: "I hope the water will
OL,7,Frecede quickly but I also know some
OL,8,Fplaces where it has entered people's
OL,9,Fhomes and businesses."
